# Normalize line endings: LF in the repo and in every checkout.
# Shell and Python here run through bash/shellcheck/python3, all of which
# choke on CRLF (shellcheck SC1017); Windows checkouts with core.autocrlf=true
# were producing exactly that.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.html text eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
